            "review_title": "Review at La Quan",
            "review_text": "Rik v\nTilburg, The Netherlands46 contributions\n0\nHighly recommended\nJun 2022 • Couples\nReally great restaurant. We visited it twice for diner. No English menu but what a delicious food. \nThey have great beef dishes. But their seafood is excellent. \nWhen we ordered a sort of hotpot with meat, veggies, prawns and squid one of the girls saw us struggling. She gently took over and helped us step by step in enjoying our dish to the max. Adding everything in the right way so the taste was optimized. We were very grateful for her help. \n\nHighly recommended\nRead more\nWritten June 7, 2022",
            "rating": 2.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
