            "review_text": "Hoang Do\n22 contributions\n1\nDecent Hot Pot Restaurant in Old Quarter\nJun 2019\nThis restaurant is pretty decent among restaurants in this price range. Their meat does not taste weird, and the beef is a bit tough, but it does not feel like the low-quality refrigerated beef at other low-price hot pot restaurants. \nThe broth is standard and quite tasty. Most importantly, I trust the food's quality.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 10, 2019",
